拆并在资产负债表中单独确认。 6.符合下列标准之一的资产管理产品：", "score": 0.93, "rerank_score": 0.83, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "mcq_rule_preamble", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "multiple_choice_evidence", "fusion_method": "mcq_exact_support_early_stop"}}]}
