）股东的控股股东、实际控制人、关联方、一致行动人、最终受益人发生变化的，相关股东应当按照法律法规及监管规定，及时将变更情况书面告知消费金融公司；", "score": 0.93, "rerank_score": 0.88, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "mcq_exact_support", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "multiple_choice_evidence", "fusion_method": "mcq_exact_support_early_stop", "exact_support_score": 0.9667}}]}
