e_choice_evidence", "fusion_method": "mcq_exact_support_early_stop", "exact_support_score": 0.9302}}, {"document_id": "DOC-20260717-F30D7E400A8C", "chunk_id": "DOC-20260717-F30D7E400A8C-CHUNK-0004", "filename": "409_商业银行资本管理办法_附件13：账簿划分和名词解释.docx", "section_title": "一、交易账簿的范围及划分的标准", "page_number": null, "excerpt": "1.不存在实施平盘或完全对冲交易的法律障碍； 2.能够每日进行公允价值计量，变动计入损益； 3.能够进行积极的管理。", "score": 0.9265116279069767, "rerank_score": 0.8765116279069767, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "mcq_exact_support", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "multiple_choice_evidence", "fusion_method": "mcq_exact_support_early_stop", "exact_support_score": 0.6471}}]}
