范围”）披露相关信息。表格中另有规定的除外。 商业银行应根据表格要求，分别按照季度、半年和年度的频率披露信息。", "score": 0.9161111111111111, "rerank_score": 0.9161111111111111, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "bounded_lexical_support", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "pillar3_disclosure_frequency", "fusion_method": "bounded_document_lexical_support", "exact_support_anchor": "商业银行第三支柱信息披露频率和表格例外", "exact_support_score": 0.7222}}]}
